      "quoted_text": "Seems like the Flyers have given the Sens a season-high number of wide open shooting lanes from the high slot tonight. Cozens has had a few and has now scored on two of them to give the Sens a 5-2 lead",
      "quoted_author": "Steve Warne",
      "quoted_handle": "SteveWarneMedia"
    },
    {
      "id": "2123607898341396858",
      "text": "The Senators blow a 5-2 lead in the third period. Sam Ersson has allowed 5 goals on 18 shots.",
